      "writtenOn": "2013-11-07T00:26:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function has been renamed to filter_formatting().\n\nBase64 text is often formatted. It\u0027s also often the case we need to work with just the alphabet characters. It\u0027s useful for the module to include such a utility because it\u0027s used so frequently.  It is often useful in the context of working with base64 data and PEM formatted data. Transforming from PEM based CMS signatures to OpenStack token ID\u0027s is one such use.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAATn//sYc\u003d",
      "revId": "1f872abb80c262e10730d86d1ef068bda0dea989",
